«
@@ σROOT — the uncertainty of the unknowns found by ROOT. Stack: the ROOT
@@ call, quoted, as in the examples of the Equation Library ▶ a list of
@@ the unknowns, each tagged with its name, as Y±σu.
@@ The variables of the equations that hold a value with an
@@ uncertainty, a±σb, or bounds a…b, a±b or a±p% (a rectangular law of
@@ standard deviation width/√12), with or without unit, are the uncertain
@@ inputs. ROOT is run with each input at its centre, then with each input
@@ moved by ±σ/100 in turn: the differences give the contribution of every
@@ input to every unknown, combined as by σRFxjxi: u² = Σ ci·ck·ρik, with
@@ the correlations of ρij if it exists, one number for all the pairs, or a
@@ list of pairs by name, { { x y ρ } … }; otherwise independent inputs. 1 + 2n runs of ROOT for n uncertain inputs. Each input
@@ gets back the value it had; the unknowns keep their central values.
@@ ROOT solves again an unknown that already exists only from its value,
@@ so the unknowns are purged before each run.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ Note: a local evaluates a name or a program that it holds, so names are
@@ kept in lists, and only numbers, units and ranges go into locals.
  1 →List
  → srtq
  «
    @ The call apart: the equations, the unknowns, the guesses. Names are
    @ kept in arrays, and arrays inside lists, never alone in a local.
    srtq 1 Get Explode Drop Drop Drop
    Explode Drop 1 →List
    Swap Eval ListExpressionNames Swap Drop 1 →List
    → srtnames srteqv
    «
      @ The uncertain inputs: { name centre σ original } for each
      0 Vars
      → srtk srtvars
      «
        1 srtvars Size For srti
          @ An unknown is not an input, even if it holds an uncertain value
          0 1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj
            srtnames 1 Get srtj Get →Text srtvars srti Get →Text == Or
          Next
          @ ... and a variable of the equations
          0 1 srteqv 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj
            srteqv 1 Get srtj Get →Text srtvars srti Get →Text == Or
          Next
          Swap Not And
          If Then
          srtvars srti Get Rcl
          Dup TypeName
          If Dup "unit" == Then Drop Dup UVAL TypeName End
          → srtt
          «
            If srtt "uncertain" == srtt "range" == Or srtt "drange" == Or srtt "prange" == Or Then
              → srtv
              «
                srtv
                If srtv TypeName "unit" == Then UVAL End
                If srtt "uncertain" == Then
                  Range→
                Else
                  →Range Range→
                  → srtlo srthi « srtlo srthi + 2 / srthi srtlo - 12 √ / »
                End
                @ Centre and σ, with the unit of the variable
                If srtv TypeName "unit" == Then
                  srtv →Unit Swap srtv →Unit Swap
                End
                → srta srts
                «
                  srtvars srti Get srta srts srtv 4 →List
                  srtk 1 + 'srtk' Sto
                »
              »
            Else
              Drop
            End
          »
          End
        Next
        srtk →List
      »
      → srtin
      «
        @ ROOT solves again an unknown that already exists only from its
        @ value, so the unknowns are purged before each run
        @ The central run
        1 srtin Size For srti
          srtin srti Get Dup 2 Get Swap 1 Get Sto
        Next
        1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj IfErr srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Purge Then End Next
        srtq 1 Get Eval Drop
        @ The values of the unknowns, as left by ROOT
          1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Rcl Next srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
          → srty0
          «
            @ For each input, its signed contribution to each unknown,
            @ derivative × σ by central differences: one list per input
            1 srtin Size For srti
              srtin srti Get Explode Drop Drop Rot Drop
              → srta srts
              «
                srta srts 100 / + srtin srti Get 1 Get Sto
                1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj IfErr srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Purge Then End Next srtq 1 Get Eval Drop
                1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Rcl Next srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
                srta srts 100 / - srtin srti Get 1 Get Sto
                1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj IfErr srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Purge Then End Next srtq 1 Get Eval Drop
                1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Rcl Next srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
                → srtp srtn
                «
                  1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj srtp srtj Get srtn srtj Get - 50 * Next
                  srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
                »
                srta srtin srti Get 1 Get Sto
              »
            Next
            srtin Size →List
            @ The correlations: ρij, one number for all the pairs, or a list
            @ of pairs by name, { { x y ρ } … }; the other pairs are 0
            IfErr 'ρij' Rcl Then Drop 0 End
            → srtcon srtr0
            «
              If srtr0 TypeName "array" == Then
                "σROOT: give ρij as a number, or as a list { { x y ρ } … }" DoError
              End
              If srtr0 TypeName "list" == Then
                1 srtr0 Size For srtm
                  If srtr0 srtm Get 3 Get Abs 1 > Then
                    "σROOT: a coefficient of ρij is outside −1…1" DoError
                  End
                Next
              Else
                If srtin Size 1 > Then
                  If srtr0 1 > srtr0 -1 srtin Size 1 - / < Or Then
                    "σROOT: ρij is outside −1/(n−1)…1 for n inputs" DoError
                  End
                End
              End
              1 srtin Size For srti
                1 srtin Size For srtk
                  If srti srtk == Then
                    1
                  Else
                    If srtr0 TypeName "list" == Then
                      0
                      1 srtr0 Size For srtm
                        srtr0 srtm Get 1 Get →Text srtin srti Get 1 Get →Text ==
                        srtr0 srtm Get 2 Get →Text srtin srtk Get 1 Get →Text == And
                        srtr0 srtm Get 1 Get →Text srtin srtk Get 1 Get →Text ==
                        srtr0 srtm Get 2 Get →Text srtin srti Get 1 Get →Text == And Or
                        If Then Drop srtr0 srtm Get 3 Get End
                      Next
                    Else
                      srtr0
                    End
                  End
                Next
                srtin Size →List
              Next
              srtin Size →List
              → srtrho
              «
                @ The central run again, so that the unknowns keep their values
                1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj IfErr srtnames 1 Get srtj Get Purge Then End Next srtq 1 Get Eval Drop
                @ Every input gets back its original value
                1 srtin Size For srti
                  srtin srti Get Dup 4 Get Swap 1 Get Sto
                Next
                @ The results: u² = Σ ci·ck·ρik, Y±σu tagged with their names
                1 srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get For srtj
                  0
                  1 srtin Size For srti
                    1 srtin Size For srtk
                      srtrho srti Get srtk Get
                      → srtr
                      «
                        If srtr 0 ≠ Then
                          srtcon srti Get srtj Get srtcon srtk Get srtj Get * srtr *
                          If Over 0 == Then Swap Drop Else + End
                        End
                      »
                    Next
                  Next
                  srty0 srtj Get
                  → srtu2 srty
                  «
                    srtu2
                    If srtu2 TypeName "unit" == Then UVAL End
                    If 0 < Then "σROOT: no quantities could have the correlations of ρij" DoError End
                    srtu2 √
                    → srtu
                    «
                      If srty TypeName "unit" == Then
                        srty UVAL srtu srty Convert UVAL →σRange srty →Unit
                      Else
                        srty srtu →σRange
                      End
                      srtnames 1 Get srtj Get →Text →Tag
                    »
                  »
                Next
                srtnames 1 Get Size 1 Get →List
              »
            »
          »
      »
    »
  »
»
